      "statement": "cacheEvidenceResolver memoizes each resource-and-prior-version resolution for exactly one processing phase (preflight, one mutation batch, or one finalization pass); a fresh wrapper is created per phase so caching never crosses a freshness boundary. The cache stores the in-flight Promise so concurrent resolutions of the same key within a phase deduplicate rather than race.",
