      "statement": "The resumeInit option distinguishes fresh init (empty state, orphans cleaned) from resumed init: when resumeInit is true an init run takes the preflight path and reloads current-run sidecars instead of discarding them as orphans. The repository lifecycle passes resumeInit true only when resuming an interrupted init.",
