      "id": "claim_630730808a73497d811a58fd5568024c",
      "statement": "ClaimSession.finalize refuses to persist any dirty page that still carries unresolved evidence debt, re-resolves all evidence against current versions before hashing, deletes orphan and disappeared-page sidecars as recoverable warnings, and writes each ready page with a fresh pageVersion hash plus a verification event only when the page has material claims.",
